<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks fell, two rose and nine were flat in an 8.2-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,575.3 points, 1.5 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in a nine-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
